The graph of $f(x)=|1-x|$ on $0\le x\le 2$ is two triangles, so the probability is the area under the graph from $0$ to $1.5$.
$$\begin{aligned} P(X\le1.5)&=\dfrac12\times1\times1+\dfrac12\times0.5\times0.5\\ &=0.625\end{aligned}$$
